<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Adelong Cons Gold lists at discount.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Adelong Cons Gold lists at discount.</headline>
<dateline>PERTH 1997-02-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in gold explorer Adelong Consolidated Gold Mines NL made their debut on the Australian Stock Exchange at 20 cents, a 5.0 cent discount to its issue price of 25 cents.</p>
<p>The float raised A$5.0 million and was underwritten by William Noall Ltd and Brenton Arnott-Smith.</p>
<p>The company's major exploration interests are in the Lachlan Fold Belt in southern New South Wales and and the southern Pine Creek geosyncline region in the Northern Territory.</p>
<p>--Walter Watson 61-2 9373 1810</p>
</text>
